  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14212968/assets/d2e2666baf2931dc4e0d8ba097a364b7b7a1bba75e65c8d802a60180e9a94854.png)\n\nNeah is flying a kite $K$ with a string of length $112\\,\\text{ft}.$ The angle of elevation $\\theta $ of the kite is increasing at a rate of $\\frac{\\pi }{28}$ radians per second. Find, as a function of $\\theta ,$ the rate at which the kite's altitude is increasing.",
